  << /ActualText (I\031m a Producer with a background in Creative Technologies and a Master\031s in Game Development from Abertay University\056 I have production experience across four games and I\031m skilled in team management\054 project management\054 communication\054 and organization\056 I\031ve worked with Agile\054 Scrum\054 and Kanban methodologies and tools such as Jira\054 Trello\054 and ClickUp\056 \nI\031m passionate about finding effective processes that support both teams and projects\054 while continuously learning about people\054 games\054 and production\056)
